      "author": "Maeve Dunne",
      "text": "I am on approved leave 6-10 July; the 6 July week is a no for me and I am required.",
      "ts": "2026-06-08T08:41:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Maren Achterberg",
      "text": "AP-DK-0104 allows rush up to 300. Buying open-market fares above the caps through Northlane is not approved \u2014 that is Rui and Ifeoma. The agenda rev 2 on the drive is the old two-day version; rev 3 is current.",
